<title>USA: Players Intl Inc Q3 Dec 31 turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Players Intl Inc Q3 Dec 31 turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, N.J. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PLAYERS INTERNATIONAL INC</p>
<p>			    3 Mos ended 12/31     9 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>				  1996     1995	 1996	1995</p>
<p> Revenues		  $64,848   $72,726   $218,866  $218,634</p>
<p> Restructuring charge	 --	  --	9,007	  --</p>
<p> Pre-opening costs	 1,190     1,373	3,077     7,525</p>
<p>Income before provision for</p>
<p>  income taxes	   (2,346)     5,430	(840)    30,425</p>
<p>Provision (benefit) for</p>
<p>  income taxes	     (915)     2,118	(327)    11,866</p>
<p> Net income (loss)     (1,431)     3,312	(513)    18,559</p>
<p> EPS (fully diluted)    (0.05)-1    0.10-2 ($0.02)-1/3 $0.57-2</p>
<p> Fully diluted shrs    30,362     31,744    30,381     32,283</p>
<p>		    (Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 includes after-tax charges of $726,000 or $0.02 a share for pre-opening costs. 1996 operating EPS would have been a loss of $0.03 a share excluding the charges.  </p>
<p>(1) 1996 nine-months includes after-tax charges of $1.9 million or $0.06 a share for pre-opening costs.</p>
<p>(2) 1995 Q3 includes charges of $0.03 a share related to pre-opening costs.</p>
<p>1995 nine months includes charges of $0.14 a share after tax related to pre-opening costs.</p>
<p>(3) Reflects a non-recurring restructuring charge of $9.0 million before tax ($5.5 million, or $.18 per share after tax).</p>
</text>
